sequenceDiagram
    title SPay asynchronous UPI payment happy path
    participant Flutter
    participant API
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant OutboxPublisher
    participant Kafka
    participant PaymentConsumer
    participant Redis
    participant Simulator

    Flutter->>API: POST /api/payments/upi
    API->>Redis: Check payment rate limit
    API->>PostgreSQL: Validate idempotency and save payment plus outbox
    PostgreSQL-->>API: Transaction committed
    API-->>Flutter: 202 with transaction ID
    OutboxPublisher->>PostgreSQL: Claim pending outbox event
    OutboxPublisher->>Kafka: Publish PaymentRequested
    Kafka-->>PaymentConsumer: Deliver event
    PaymentConsumer->>Redis: Acquire account locks
    PaymentConsumer->>PostgreSQL: Lock rows and validate balance
    PaymentConsumer->>Simulator: Resolve processing outcome
    Simulator-->>PaymentConsumer: Success
    PaymentConsumer->>PostgreSQL: Post ledger and mark success
    Flutter->>API: GET /api/payments/id
    API-->>Flutter: SUCCESS receipt
